      "text": "REFS\n\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/proceduralgeneration/comments/8apk1b/procedural_city_generation_in_games/\nhttps://github.com/cleverraven/cataclysm-dda\n\n여기서는 가장 닮은 분위기를 가진 CATACLYSM으로 할것.",
